WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.552
Claude, ChatGPT, Copilot, and Gemini connect to Sessionboard by signing you in. That sign-in is OAuth. You don't paste an API token, and there's nothing to switch on inside Sessionboard first.

2
00:00:15.552 --> 00:00:26.856
In Claude, open Customize, then Connectors, then Discover, and add Sessionboard. That directory listing uses the United States server.

3
00:00:26.856 --> 00:00:40.704
If your organization is in Europe or the Middle East, add a custom connector instead and paste the server URL for that region. Claude opens Sessionboard. Sign in, pick the organization, and choose Authorize.

4
00:00:40.704 --> 00:00:49.416
ChatGPT works the same way. On a paid plan, turn on developer mode under Settings, Security and login.

5
00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:57.120
Create a plugin, paste your region's server URL, and leave Authentication on OAuth.

6
00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:05.136
After you authorize, ask what events you have in Sessionboard. ChatGPT calls Sessionboard and answers from your data.

7
00:01:05.136 --> 00:01:17.640
Two things have to already be true. AI features are on for the organization, and your role includes Connect AI assistants. Organization administrators already have that permission.
